      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-10-07-shadow-statue.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "feature-atm10-sky",
      "title": "ATM10空岛中文支持进入社区近期更新栏",
      "summary": "本轮BBSMC首页列出ATM10空岛汉化累计约3.7万下载、11关注，并出现在近期更新区。整合包从树与单方块起步，逐步展开科技、魔法与任务。",
      "source": "BBSMC",
      "date": "2026-10-07",
      "url": "https://bbsmc.net/modpack/all-the-mods-10-sky",
      "image": "game-brief-assets/2026-10-07-atm-sky.png"
    }
  ],
